<title>USA: Genesis Development posts Q1 net.</title>
<headline>Genesis Development posts Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Genesis Development and Construction Ltd said on Friday that it reported first quarter net income of $376,859, or $0.22 a share on sales of $5.51 million.</p>
<p>The Israeli company conducted its initial public offering in February 1997, raising $9.4 million.</p>
